---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
import headshot from '../assets/photos/headshot.jpg';
---

<header class="hero container" id="top">
  <div class="grid">
  <div class="copy">
  <p class="hello" data-reveal>Hello, I'm</p>
  <h1 data-reveal style="--i:1">Tan De Xun.</h1>
  <p class="intro" data-reveal style="--i:2">
    I build software with AI, and I'm curious about how far it can go. I study Computer Science at
    <strong>NUS</strong>, interned as a full-stack developer at <strong>A*STAR</strong>, and spent two years
    blocking scam websites with the <strong>Singapore Police Force</strong>.
  </p>
  <p class="intro sub" data-reveal style="--i:3">
    Most days that means giving AI agents a clear brief, spending tokens where they matter, and checking
    everything they write with tests before it ships. When a new tool or technology comes out, I learn it by
    building something real with it.
  </p>
  <div class="ctas" data-reveal style="--i:4">
    <a class="btn primary" href="#work">See my work</a>
    <a class="btn" href={profile.resume} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Résumé (PDF)</a>
    <a class="btn" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Email me</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="facts" data-reveal style="--i:5">
    <li><span>Based in</span>Singapore</li>
    <li><span>Studying</span>Computer Science, NUS (Year 1)</li>
    <li><span>Looking for</span>Summer 2027 SWE internships</li>
  </ul>
  </div>
  <figure class="portrait" data-reveal style="--i:2">
    <Image src={headshot} alt="Tan De Xun smiling in an open-plan office" widths={[320, 480, 640]} sizes="(max-width: 860px) 60vw, 320px" format="webp" quality={80} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" class="portrait-img" />
  </figure>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-top: clamp(120px, 16vw, 180px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 8vw, 96px);
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .copy {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .portrait {
    margin: 52px 0 0;
  }
  .portrait :global(.portrait-img) {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 45% 30%;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .portrait {
      order: -1;
      margin: 0;
      width: min(220px, 60vw);
    }
  }
  .hello {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(56px, 10vw, 120px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }
  .intro {
    font-size: clamp(19px, 2.1vw, 23px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 34em;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .intro strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .intro.sub {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.7vw, 19px);
  }
  .ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 34px 0 44px;
  }
  .facts {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 18px 0 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .facts span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--faint);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
</style>
